Exercise real typed RPC whitelist denial with a final oversized method string. The copied original_method must retain a prefix and expose fields_truncated; public synthetic credentials only. Preserve HTTP403 and cleanstop. This fixture follows the typed-RPC owner06017 whose fields/event it asserts; it cannot fold into earlier generic API owner54360. Confirmed by git show of06017; final-line blame on later SQLite ownerb9fe only reflects its added backslash, not field/event introduction.

Before: immutable128 daemon a0125cc1 produces1212→424byte truncation without marker and fails exact assertion after authenticated request/stop (1.2287s, groupempty). Generic API recordflag fix and last-only native control are separate54360 fixup. AFTER pending actual normal gate; Ruff0.15.8 passes.
---
 .../functional/feature_logging_last_string.py | 65 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 65 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 test/functional/feature_logging_last_string.py

diff --git a/test/functional/feature_logging_last_string.py b/test/functional/feature_logging_last_string.py
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..372a057e659f58bbcd9f850017b534c0c1a50fc9
--- /dev/null
+++ b/test/functional/feature_logging_last_string.py
@@ -0,0 +1,65 @@
+#!/usr/bin/env python3
+# Copyright (c) 2026 The Lotus developers
